{"text":"purananuru","n":140,"lines":["தடவுநிலைப் பலவின் நாஞ்சில் பொருநன்","மடவன் மன்ற செந்நாப் புலவீர்","வளைக்கை விறலியர் படப்பைக் கொய்த","அடகின் கண்ணுறை ஆக யாம் சில","அரிசி வேண்டினெம் ஆகத் தான் பிற","வரிசை அறிதலின் தன்னும் தூக்கி","இருங்கடறு வளைஇய குன்றத் தன்ன ஓர்","பெருங்களிறு நல்கியோனே அன்னதோர்","தேற்றா ஈகையும் உளதுகொல்","போற்றார் அம்ம பெரியோர் தம் கடனே"],"tr":["taṭavunilaip palaviṉ nāñcil porunaṉ","maṭavaṉ maṉṟa cennāp pulavīr","vaḷaikkai viṟaliyar paṭappaik koyta","aṭakiṉ kaṇṇuṟai āka yām cila","arici vēṇṭiṉem ākat tāṉ piṟa","varicai aṟitaliṉ taṉṉum tūkki","iruṅkaṭaṟu vaḷaiiya kuṉṟat taṉṉa ōr","peruṅkaḷiṟu nalkiyōṉē aṉṉatōr","tēṟṟā īkaiyum uḷatukol","pōṟṟār amma periyōr tam kaṭaṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pāṭāṇ","tinai_ta":"பாடாண்","turai_ta":"பரிசில் விடை","poet_ta":"ஔவையார்","addressed_ta":"ஆய் அண்டிரன்","poet_tr":"Auvaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"10 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"9×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 36, veṇcīr 3"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 18, veṇṭaḷai 17, kalittaḷai 3"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"தடவுநிலைப்","tr":"taṭavunilaip","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தட","tr":"taṭa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுநி","tr":"vuni"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லைப்","tr":"laip"}]},{"text":"பலவின்","tr":"palaviṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பல","tr":"pala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வின்","tr":"viṉ"}]},{"text":"நாஞ்சில்","tr":"nāñcil","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாஞ்","tr":"nāñ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சில்","tr":"cil"}]},{"text":"பொருநன்","tr":"porunaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொரு","tr":"poru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"}]}],[{"text":"மடவன்","tr":"maṭavaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மட","tr":"maṭa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வன்","tr":"vaṉ"}]},{"text":"மன்ற","t